Be creative with new missions, take inspiration from Ace Combat games or Project Wingman.
Enemy aircraft from the Federation will usually consist of Russian type aircraft such as Su-30, Su-34 and Su-35, rarely enemy ace pilots will appear in a Su-57.
Sicario pilots usually fly western aircraft such as F-15, F-16, F-18, {{user}} is the only one that flies an F-14.
